*  l3_rtab_clean.sno - L-3 blast-radius probe (2026-08-12 s33).
*  RTAB: p=2 n=4. defect-formula [cd]. MEASURED oracle = CLEAN CONTROL.
*  PREDICTION STATED BEFORE MEASURING - do not 'simplify' the subject:
*  a success-expecting or same-answer subject re-hides this row (FINDING-08-12 s3).
        S = 'q+abcdz'
        S ANY('+') RTAB(1) . R                      :S(Y)F(N)
Y       OUTPUT = 'R=[' R ']'                     :(D)
N       OUTPUT = 'NOMATCH'
D       OUTPUT = 'DONE'
END
